{
  "name": "Slack Standup Bot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Daily 9AM Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#standup",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":sunrise: *Daily Standup Time!*\n\nPlease reply in a thread with:\n1. :white_check_mark: What did you accomplish yesterday?\n2. :dart: What are you working on today?\n3. :no_entry_sign: Any blockers?",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post Standup Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [480, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 11 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Collect at 11AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [260, 520]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "channel",
        "operation": "history",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#standup",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "limit": 50,
        "filters": {}
      },
      "name": "Fetch Standup Replies",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [480, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst responses = items.map(item => {\n  const msg = item.json;\n  return {\n    user: msg.user || 'Unknown',\n    text: msg.text || '',\n    timestamp: msg.ts || ''\n  };\n});\n\nlet summary = ':clipboard: *Standup Summary*\\n\\n';\nfor (const r of responses) {\n  if (r.text && r.text.length > 5) {\n    summary += `*<@${r.user}>*:\\n${r.text}\\n\\n`;\n  }\n}\n\nconst blockers = responses.filter(r => \n  r.text.toLowerCase().includes('blocker') || r.text.toLowerCase().includes('blocked')\n);\n\nif (blockers.length > 0) {\n  summary += ':rotating_light: *Blockers Identified:*\\n';\n  blockers.forEach(b => {\n    summary += `- <@${b.user}>: ${b.text}\\n`;\n  });\n}\n\nreturn [{json: {summary, responseCount: responses.length, hasBlockers: blockers.length > 0, date: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]}}];"
      },
      "name": "Compile Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [700, 520]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#standup",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.summary }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [920, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Standups",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Log to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1140, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Slack Standup Bot\n\nAutomated daily standup collection and summarization.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Post standup prompt at 9AM weekdays\n2. Collect replies at 11AM\n3. Compile summary with blocker detection\n4. Post summary back to channel\n5. Archive to Google Sheets\n\n**Setup:**\n- Create #standup channel\n- Configure Slack credentials\n- Set Google Sheets document ID",
        "width": 340,
        "height": 320
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [20, 260]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 9AM Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Standup Prompt",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Collect at 11AM": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Standup Replies",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Standup Replies": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Compile Summary",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Compile Summary": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Summary",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Post Summary": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log to Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}